## 📁 Directory Structure

```
Emily-SLM/
├── configs/                    # Model & training configurations (YAML)
│   ├── tiny.yaml               # 2L/4H/128D — for testing (~1M params)
│   ├── small.yaml              # 4L/8H/256D — trainable on consumer GPU (~10M)
│   ├── base.yaml               # 8L/8H/512D — baseline (~85M params)
│   ├── medium.yaml             # 12L/12H/768D — GPT-2 scale (~117M params)
│   └── large.yaml              # 24L/16H/1024D — larger scale (~350M params)
│
├── datasets/                   # Data storage
│   ├── raw/                    # Raw text files
│   ├── processed/              # Cleaned & deduplicated
│   └── tokenized/              # Tokenized binary files (train.bin, val.bin)
│
├── slm/                        # Core library
│   ├── config.py               # ModelConfig, TrainingConfig, EmilyConfig
│   ├── model/                  # Model implementation
│   │   ├── model.py            # EmilySLM — full model
│   │   └── layers/             # Individual layer implementations
│   │       ├── attention.py    # CausalSelfAttention, GQA, KVCache
│   │       ├── embedding.py    # TokenEmbedding, PositionalEmbedding
│   │       ├── mlp.py          # SwiGLU, GeLUMLP
│   │       ├── rmsnorm.py      # RMSNorm
│   │       ├── rotary.py       # RotaryEmbedding, apply_rotary_emb
│   │       └── transformer.py  # TransformerBlock
│   ├── tokenizer/              # BPE tokenizer
│   │   ├── tokenizer.py        # EmilyTokenizer
│   │   ├── special_tokens.py   # SpecialTokens dataclass
│   │   └── chat_template.py    # ChatTemplate
│   ├── training/               # Training pipeline
│   │   ├── trainer.py          # EmilyTrainer
│   │   ├── optimizer.py        # Optimizer & scheduler factory
│   │   ├── callbacks.py        # Checkpoint, EarlyStopping, Logging callbacks
│   │   └── data_loader.py      # Dataset & DataLoader utilities
│   ├── dataset/                # Data pipeline
│   │   ├── loader.py           # DatasetLoader (JSONL, HuggingFace, raw text)
│   │   ├── preprocessor.py     # Cleaning, deduplication, normalization
│   │   └── collator.py         # CausalLMCollator
│   ├── evaluation/             # Evaluation & benchmarks
│   │   ├── evaluator.py        # EmilyEvaluator
│   │   └── benchmarks.py       # Benchmark suites
│   ├── inference/              # Inference engine
│   │   ├── engine.py           # EmilyInferenceEngine
│   │   └── sampler.py          # Sampling utilities
│   ├── api/                    # FastAPI REST server
│   │   ├── app.py              # FastAPI application
│   │   ├── routes/             # Route modules
│   │   └── schemas.py          # Request/Response models
│   ├── cli/                    # CLI entrypoints
│   │   └── main.py             # Click CLI
│   ├── frontend/               # Gradio demo
│   │   └── demo.py
│   └── utils/                  # Utilities
│       ├── logging.py          # Logger setup
│       ├── device.py           # Device detection, memory utils
│       └── checkpoint.py       # Checkpoint save/load
│
├── scripts/                    # Runnable scripts
│   ├── train.py                # Training entrypoint
│   ├── evaluate.py             # Evaluation entrypoint
│   ├── prepare_data.py         # Data preparation
│   └── export.py               # ONNX / quantization export
│
├── tests/                      # pytest test suite
│   ├── test_config.py
│   ├── test_model.py
│   ├── test_tokenizer.py
│   ├── test_training.py
│   ├── test_evaluation.py
│   └── test_api.py
│
├── docs/                       # Documentation
│   ├── architecture.md
│   ├── training_guide.md
│   ├── inference_guide.md
│   ├── dataset_guide.md
│   ├── configuration_guide.md
│   └── deployment_guide.md
│
├── checkpoints/                # Saved model checkpoints (gitignored)
├── logs/                       # TensorBoard & training logs (gitignored)
├── examples/                   # Jupyter notebooks & usage examples
├── pyproject.toml              # Project metadata & dependencies
└── README.md                   # This file
```

