## ⚙️ Model Configurations

| Config  | Layers | Heads | d_model | d_ff  | Vocab  | Context | Params   |
|---------|--------|-------|---------|-------|--------|---------|----------|
| tiny    | 2      | 4     | 128     | 512   | 4,096  | 256     | ~1M      |
| small   | 4      | 8     | 256     | 1,024 | 16,384 | 512     | ~10M     |
| base    | 8      | 8     | 512     | 2,048 | 32,000 | 1,024   | ~85M     |
| medium  | 12     | 12    | 768     | 3,072 | 32,000 | 2,048   | ~117M    |
| large   | 24     | 16    | 1,024   | 4,096 | 32,000 | 2,048   | ~350M    |

---

## 🔬 Features

### Model
- [x] Decoder-only transformer (GPT-style)
- [x] Rotary Position Embeddings (RoPE)
- [x] SwiGLU activation
- [x] RMSNorm (pre-normalization)
- [x] Causal self-attention with causal masking
- [x] Grouped Query Attention (GQA)
- [x] KV Cache for fast inference
- [x] Flash Attention (via `F.scaled_dot_product_attention`)
- [x] Weight tying (embedding ↔ LM head)
- [x] Temperature / Top-K / Top-P sampling
- [x] Beam search
- [x] Streaming generation

### Training
- [x] Gradient accumulation
- [x] Mixed precision (BF16/FP16)
- [x] Gradient clipping
- [x] Checkpoint save & resume
- [x] Early stopping
- [x] Cosine LR schedule with warmup
- [x] AdamW optimizer
- [x] TensorBoard logging
- [x] Weights & Biases integration

### Tokenizer
- [x] BPE tokenizer trained from scratch
- [x] Special tokens for chat & tool calling
- [x] Streaming tokenization
- [x] Chat template formatting

### Future
- [ ] Instruction tuning (SFT)
- [ ] LoRA / QLoRA fine-tuning
- [ ] RLHF
- [ ] Vision encoder
- [ ] Speech integration
- [ ] Tool calling
- [ ] RAG integration

